  "content": [
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:27 AM",
      "text": "Can you find out who’s being traded? Apparently it’s a small deal but I haven’t been told anything yet"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:55 PM",
      "text": "Dario Agrazal from the Pittsburgh Pirates in exchange for cash considerations."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:58 PM",
      "text": "Love you"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:59 PM",
      "text": "Wait five minutes on it"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:59 PM",
      "text": "Ok let me know when"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:59 PM",
      "text": "The Tigers are close to acquiring right-hander Dario Agrazal from the Pirates for cash considerations, I'm told."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:59 PM",
      "text": "Is what I’m putting"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:00 PM",
      "text": "Let me break it, though"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "1:00 PM",
      "text": "I will, I just heard though so I don’t want to make it too obvious."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:01 PM",
      "text": "Ok... I’m going to check up with Al again"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:08 PM",
      "text": "When are they announcing it"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "1:09 PM",
      "text": "1:20 I think. Go with it any time after 1:10"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:09 PM",
      "text": "Ok"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:12 PM",
      "text": "I’m putting it out there"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "1:12 PM",
      "text": "Alright"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:12 PM",
      "text": "Thanks... call me later"
    }
  ]
